<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>With Rob As My Witness</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Lovejoy</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">One Simple Trick</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">1XWxUhwNBfKWP8KA1NY9xu</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.627" end="00:26.045">Sink yourself into me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.045" end="00:32.380">Like a drug into a sickness</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.380" end="00:38.678">Nostalgia guarantee</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.678" end="00:44.708">Sentimental little weakness</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.708" end="00:46.208">By a stroke of</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.141" end="00:47.723">Lack of focus</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.723" end="00:50.896">I am back in your old direction</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.896" end="00:55.905">Guess I was growing too tired of the apogee</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.905" end="00:57.691">But I don't mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.691" end="01:02.148">You can keep that stereo</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.148" end="01:04.117">And I don't mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.117" end="01:08.597">We can leave it at a wishlist</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.597" end="01:10.162">Please be kind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.162" end="01:14.923">You know the big man's got your vote</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.923" end="01:16.806">When comes the time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.806" end="01:23.066">That Rob's your only witness</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.066" end="01:29.091">There's no upsetting me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.091" end="01:35.428">Little life left in the seabed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.428" end="01:41.736">Leapt from chord to the key</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.736" end="01:47.558">And dropped directly in the deep end</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.558" end="01:49.254">On the coast of</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.254" end="01:50.792">Atlantic Ocean</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.792" end="01:54.161">I am back in your old direction</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.161" end="01:59.086">Swimming only in spite of the apathy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.086" end="02:00.718">And I don't mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.718" end="02:05.349">You can keep that stereo</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.349" end="02:07.305">And I don't mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.305" end="02:11.748">We can leave it at a wishlist</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.748" end="02:13.673">Please be kind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.673" end="02:18.020">You know the big man's got your vote</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.020" end="02:20.064">When comes the time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.064" end="02:28.064">That Rob's your only witness</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.416" end="02:53.239">And I don't mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.239" end="02:55.903">You can keep that stereo</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:55.903" end="02:57.873">And I don't mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:57.873" end="03:02.217">We can leave it at a wishlist</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:02.217" end="03:04.191">Just please be kind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:04.191" end="03:08.573">You know the big man's got your vote</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:08.573" end="03:10.458">When comes the time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:10.458" end="03:13.710">That Rob's your only witness</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:13.710" end="03:16.962">You know Rob's your only witness</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:16.962" end="03:20.962">Oh Rob's your only witness</p></div></body></tt>